{"name":"Baton Rouge","hex":"#b8292b","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Baton Rouge","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["The capital city of the state of Louisiana in the United States and the parish seat of East Baton Rouge Parish."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Baton_Rouge"}],"entries":[{"title":"Baton Rouge (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Baton Rouge was an American hard rock band formed in 1986 in Pearl River, Louisiana. The band produced two albums and enjoyed limited success during the final part of the hair metal explosion in the early 1990s, before disbanding. All the band members went on to work with other hard rock recording artists, guitarist Lance Bulen with Puzzle Gut and Kingbaby, vocalist Kelly Keeling with Michael Schenker Group and Trans-Siberian Orchestra."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/34/Baton_Rouge_1991.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baton_Rouge_(band)","wikidata":"Q3636207"},{"title":"Baton Rouge, Louisiana","blocks":[{"text":"Baton Rouge is the capital city of the U.S. state of Louisiana. It had a population of 227,470 at the 2020 United States census, making it Louisiana's second-most populous city. It is the seat of Louisiana's most populous parish, East Baton Rouge Parish, and the center of Louisiana's second-largest metropolitan area, Greater Baton Rouge, which had 870,569 residents in 2020."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Downtown_Baton_Rouge%2C_Louisiana_from_Tiger_Stadium_%28LSU%29.jpg/330px-Downtown_Baton_Rouge%2C_Louisiana_from_Tiger_Stadium_%28LSU%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baton_Rouge%2C_Louisiana","wikidata":"Q28218"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Louisiana_Old_State_Capitol_recolorized.jpg/500px-Lo